Cosmo Plugin Loader
===================

Source: new Cosmopolitan-local utility.

Purpose: Load position-independent `.a` archives as plugins for embedded
languages (Ruby/Python/Lua/etc.) without modifying Cosmopolitan core. Provides
runtime ELF loader, relocation engine, TLS shim, and host-export resolution
using data embedded in the host binary.

Notes:
- Lives entirely in third_party/ to respect the "no core edits" rule.
- Export tables are generated from linked `.dbg` images
  by an accompanying script; no header scraping.
- Intended to be linked by language runtimes as an opt-in helper.
